{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;One who looks outside, dreams. One who look inside, awakens.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in your room to an unsettling world of disturbing creatures. The world you know has warped into something sinister. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore an expansive landscape of eerie, dreamlike, and unsettling worlds. Find your way through the unknown as your sanity slowly slips away.</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611760/extras/4793a5764061f6c43820684266647c12.poster.avif?t=1756833340\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611760/extras/4793a5764061f6c43820684266647c12.webm?t=1756833340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611760/extras/4793a5764061f6c43820684266647c12.mp4?t=1756833340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Confront your shadows and uncover buried memories.\u00a0High-stake combat puts you on the edge and requires you to use your resources carefully.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611760/extras/d6962baf41f12fe2b922a3d138ec6857.poster.avif?t=1756833340\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611760/extras/d6962baf41f12fe2b922a3d138ec6857.webm?t=1756833340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611760/extras/d6962baf41f12fe2b922a3d138ec6857.mp4?t=1756833340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage resources and customize your play style using a wide range of weapons and equipment.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611760/extras/8a2022e9c4891e6faa3007a86e952b97.poster.avif?t=1756833340\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611760/extras/8a2022e9c4891e6faa3007a86e952b97.webm?t=1756833340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611760/extras/8a2022e9c4891e6faa3007a86e952b97.mp4?t=1756833340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you lose yourself to madness and delusion, or confront the truth and find salvation?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 10 hours of single-player content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanity system that adds to the tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different endings depending on your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement system similar to early Goldsrc titles and developer console.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connections to analytical psychology.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3611760?t=1756833340","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3611760?t=1756833340","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611760/6bde5386a4bd88cefbbba26b84dde4fa4c40931c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756833340","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611760/6bde5